Package: InkAgro
Title: Automated Analysis of Agricultural Field Experiments in Spanish
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Bryan Joseph", "Chavez Velaisosa", 
           email = "7366989122@untrm.edu.pe", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analyses agricultural field experiments with a single call:
    reads the data, verifies that its structure matches the declared
    experimental design (completely randomised, randomised complete block,
    two-factor factorial and split-plot designs), fits the analysis of
    variance, checks the model assumptions, flags outliers without silently
    removing them, and compares treatment means with the tests implemented
    in 'agricolae'. Results are reported in Spanish for students and
    researchers without prior training in R.
